{"config":{"separator":"[\\s\\-_,:!=\\[\\]()\\\\\"`/]+|\\.(?!\\d)"},"items":[{"location":"","level":1,"title":"Commit And Tag Version","text":"<p>Convenience wrappers for <code>commit-and-tag-version</code> release automation. Includes preview and guided release flow with an optional GitHub draft.</p>","path":["Commit And Tag Version"],"tags":[]},{"location":"#functions","level":2,"title":"Functions","text":"<ul> <li><code>verg</code>: Preview next version, run release, push commits and tags, and draft   a GitHub release. If run outside the repository root, <code>verg</code> prompts to   change directories; if run outside a git repo, it exits. When   <code>zensical.toml</code> is present and you confirm the release flow, <code>verg</code> runs   <code>zensical build --clean</code> and commits updated <code>site/</code> output before the   release commit.</li> </ul>","path":["Commit And Tag Version"],"tags":[]},{"location":"#aliases","level":2,"title":"Aliases","text":"<ul> <li><code>ver</code>: Run <code>npx commit-and-tag-version</code>.</li> <li><code>veras</code>: Run <code>npx commit-and-tag-version --release-as</code>.</li> </ul>","path":["Commit And Tag Version"],"tags":[]},{"location":"CHANGELOG/","level":1,"title":"Changelog","text":"<p>All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file. See commit-and-tag-version for commit guidelines.</p>","path":["Changelog"],"tags":[]},{"location":"CHANGELOG/#0013-2026-05-31","level":2,"title":"0.0.13 (2026-05-31)","text":"","path":["Changelog"],"tags":[]},{"location":"CHANGELOG/#bug-fixes","level":3,"title":"Bug Fixes","text":"<ul> <li>verg: wait longer before opening release draft (4bc19be)</li> </ul>","path":["Changelog"],"tags":[]},{"location":"CHANGELOG/#0012-2026-03-27","level":2,"title":"0.0.12 (2026-03-27)","text":"","path":["Changelog"],"tags":[]},{"location":"CHANGELOG/#features","level":3,"title":"Features","text":"<ul> <li>verg: prompt to switch to repo root (3b63fec)</li> </ul>","path":["Changelog"],"tags":[]},{"location":"CHANGELOG/#0011-2026-03-27","level":2,"title":"0.0.11 (2026-03-27)","text":"","path":["Changelog"],"tags":[]},{"location":"CHANGELOG/#bug-fixes_1","level":3,"title":"Bug Fixes","text":"<ul> <li>verg: require repository root (c81043a)</li> </ul>","path":["Changelog"],"tags":[]},{"location":"CHANGELOG/#0010-2026-03-18","level":2,"title":"0.0.10 (2026-03-18)","text":"","path":["Changelog"],"tags":[]},{"location":"CHANGELOG/#features_1","level":3,"title":"Features","text":"<ul> <li>verg: streamline release confirmation (c05c847)</li> </ul>","path":["Changelog"],"tags":[]},{"location":"CHANGELOG/#009-2026-03-13","level":2,"title":"0.0.9 (2026-03-13)","text":"","path":["Changelog"],"tags":[]},{"location":"CHANGELOG/#features_2","level":3,"title":"Features","text":"<ul> <li>verg: default release-as for first release (c221999)</li> </ul>","path":["Changelog"],"tags":[]},{"location":"CHANGELOG/#008-2026-03-13","level":2,"title":"0.0.8 (2026-03-13)","text":"","path":["Changelog"],"tags":[]},{"location":"CHANGELOG/#features_3","level":3,"title":"Features","text":"<ul> <li>verg: add spinners for gh steps (0ff59ab)</li> <li>verg: add spinners for git pushes (1c07472)</li> <li>verg: delay opening release draft (eb683db)</li> <li>verg: show spinner before opening draft (c67c315)</li> <li>verg: use latest changelog section for draft (979e29f)</li> </ul>","path":["Changelog"],"tags":[]},{"location":"CHANGELOG/#bug-fixes_2","level":3,"title":"Bug Fixes","text":"<ul> <li>verg: keep changelog preamble in draft notes (31ff64e)</li> </ul>","path":["Changelog"],"tags":[]},{"location":"CHANGELOG/#007-2026-01-15","level":2,"title":"0.0.7 (2026-01-15)","text":"","path":["Changelog"],"tags":[]},{"location":"CHANGELOG/#features_4","level":3,"title":"Features","text":"<ul> <li>function: allow passing arguments to commit-and-tag-version (1bb957b)</li> </ul>","path":["Changelog"],"tags":[]},{"location":"CHANGELOG/#006-2025-12-11","level":2,"title":"0.0.6 (2025-12-